#: ../../library/rp2.rst:4
msgid ":mod:`rp2` --- functionality specific to the RP2040"
msgstr ":mod:`rp2` --- fungsionalitas khusus untuk RP2040"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:9
msgid ""
"The ``rp2`` module contains functions and classes specific to the RP2040, as"
" used in the Raspberry Pi Pico."
msgstr ""
"Modul ``rp2`` berisi fungsi dan kelas yang khusus untuk RP2040, sebagaimana "
"digunakan pada Raspberry Pi Pico."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:12
msgid ""
"See the `RP2040 Python datasheet "
"<https://datasheets.raspberrypi.com/pico/raspberry-pi-pico-python-sdk.pdf>`_"
" for more information, and `pico-micropython-examples "
"<https://github.com/raspberrypi/pico-micropython-examples/tree/master/pio>`_"
" for example code."
msgstr ""
"Lihat `RP2040 Python datasheet "
"<https://datasheets.raspberrypi.com/pico/raspberry-pi-pico-python-sdk.pdf>`_"
" untuk informasi lebih lanjut, dan `pico-micropython-examples "
"<https://github.com/raspberrypi/pico-micropython-examples/tree/master/pio>`_"
" untuk contoh kode."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:20
msgid "PIO related functions"
msgstr "Fungsi terkait PIO"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:22
msgid "The ``rp2`` module includes functions for assembling PIO programs."
msgstr "Modul ``rp2`` mencakup fungsi untuk merakit program PIO."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:24
msgid "For running PIO programs, see :class:`rp2.StateMachine`."
msgstr "Untuk menjalankan program PIO, lihat :class:`rp2.StateMachine`\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:28
msgid "Assemble a PIO program."
msgstr "Rakit sebuah program PIO."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:30
msgid ""
"The following parameters control the initial state of the GPIO pins, as one "
"of `PIO.IN_LOW`, `PIO.IN_HIGH`, `PIO.OUT_LOW` or `PIO.OUT_HIGH`. If the "
"program uses more than one pin, provide a tuple, e.g. "
"``out_init=(PIO.OUT_LOW, PIO.OUT_LOW)``."
msgstr ""
"Parameter berikut mengontrol keadaan awal pin GPIO, sebagai salah satu dari "
"`PIO.IN_LOW`\\ , `PIO.IN_HIGH`\\ , `PIO.OUT_LOW` atau `PIO.OUT_HIGH`\\ . "
"Jika program menggunakan lebih dari satu pin, berikan tuple, misalnya "
"``out_init=(PIO.OUT_LOW, PIO.OUT_LOW)``\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:35
msgid "*out_init* configures the pins used for ``out()`` instructions."
msgstr ""
"*out_init* mengonfigurasi pin yang digunakan untuk instruksi ``out()``\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:36
msgid ""
"*set_init* configures the pins used for ``set()`` instructions. There can be"
" at most 5."
msgstr ""
"*set_init* mengonfigurasi pin yang digunakan untuk instruksi ``set()``\\ . "
"Maksimal ada 5."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:38
msgid ""
"*sideset_init* configures the pins used for ``.side()`` modifiers. There can"
" be at most 5."
msgstr ""
"*sideset_init* mengonfigurasi pin yang digunakan untuk modifier "
"``.side()``\\ . Maksimal ada 5."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:40
msgid ""
"*side_pindir* when set to ``True`` configures ``.side()`` modifiers to be "
"used for pin directions, instead of pin values (the default, when "
"``False``)."
msgstr ""
"*side_pindir* bila diatur ke ``True`` mengonfigurasi modifier ``.side()`` "
"untuk digunakan sebagai arah pin, bukan nilai pin (nilai default saat "
"``False``\\ )."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:43
msgid ""
"The following parameters are used by default, but can be overridden in "
"`StateMachine.init()`:"
msgstr ""
"Parameter berikut digunakan secara default, tetapi dapat ditimpa di "
"`StateMachine.init()`\\ :"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:46
msgid ""
"*in_shiftdir* is the default direction the ISR will shift, either "
"`PIO.SHIFT_LEFT` or `PIO.SHIFT_RIGHT`."
msgstr ""
"*in_shiftdir* adalah arah default ISR akan bergeser, baik `PIO.SHIFT_LEFT` "
"maupun `PIO.SHIFT_RIGHT`\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:48
msgid ""
"*out_shiftdir* is the default direction the OSR will shift, either "
"`PIO.SHIFT_LEFT` or `PIO.SHIFT_RIGHT`."
msgstr ""
"*out_shiftdir* adalah arah default OSR akan bergeser, baik `PIO.SHIFT_LEFT` "
"maupun `PIO.SHIFT_RIGHT`\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:50
msgid ""
"*push_thresh* is the threshold in bits before auto-push or conditional re-"
"pushing is triggered."
msgstr ""
"*push_thresh* adalah ambang batas dalam bit sebelum auto-push atau "
"conditional re-pushing dipicu."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:52
msgid ""
"*pull_thresh* is the threshold in bits before auto-pull or conditional re-"
"pulling is triggered."
msgstr ""
"*pull_thresh* adalah ambang batas dalam bit sebelum auto-pull atau "
"conditional re-pulling dipicu."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:55
msgid "The remaining parameters are:"
msgstr "Parameter yang tersisa adalah:"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:57
msgid "*autopush* configures whether auto-push is enabled."
msgstr "*autopush* mengonfigurasi apakah auto-push diaktifkan."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:58
msgid "*autopull* configures whether auto-pull is enabled."
msgstr "*autopull* mengonfigurasi apakah auto-pull diaktifkan."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:59
msgid ""
"*fifo_join* configures whether the 4-word TX and RX FIFOs should be combined"
" into a single 8-word FIFO for one direction only. The options are "
"`PIO.JOIN_NONE`, `PIO.JOIN_RX` and `PIO.JOIN_TX`."
msgstr ""
"*fifo_join* mengonfigurasi apakah TX FIFO 4-kata dan RX FIFO harus "
"digabungkan menjadi satu FIFO 8-kata untuk satu arah saja. Pilihannya adalah"
" `PIO.JOIN_NONE`\\ , `PIO.JOIN_RX` dan `PIO.JOIN_TX`\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:65
msgid ""
"Assemble a single PIO instruction. You usually want to use `asm_pio()` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Rakit satu instruksi PIO. Biasanya Anda ingin menggunakan `asm_pio()` "
"sebagai gantinya."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:73
msgid ""
"Temporarily turns the QSPI_SS pin into an input and reads its value, "
"returning 1 for low and 0 for high. On a typical RP2040 board with a BOOTSEL"
" button, a return value of 1 indicates that the button is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Sementara mengubah pin QSPI_SS menjadi input dan membaca nilainya, "
"mengembalikan 1 untuk rendah dan 0 untuk tinggi. Pada board RP2040 yang umum"
" dengan tombol BOOTSEL, nilai kembalian 1 menunjukkan bahwa tombol ditekan."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:78
msgid ""
"Since this function temporarily disables access to the external flash "
"memory, it also temporarily disables interrupts and the other core to "
"prevent them from trying to execute code from flash."
msgstr ""
"Karena fungsi ini sementara menonaktifkan akses ke memori flash eksternal, "
"fungsi ini juga sementara menonaktifkan interupsi dan inti lainnya untuk "
"mencegah mereka mencoba mengeksekusi kode dari flash."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:84
msgid ""
"This exception is raised from `asm_pio()` or `asm_pio_encode()` if there is "
"an error assembling a PIO program."
msgstr ""
"Pengecualian ini dimunculkan dari `asm_pio()` atau `asm_pio_encode()` jika "
"terjadi kesalahan saat merakit program PIO."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:89
msgid "PIO assembly language instructions"
msgstr "Instruksi bahasa rakitan PIO"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:91
msgid ""
"PIO state machines are programmed in a custom assembly language with nine "
"core PIO-machine instructions.  In MicroPython, PIO assembly routines are "
"written as a Python function with the decorator ``@rp2.asm_pio()``, and they"
" use Python syntax.  Such routines support standard Python variables and "
"arithmetic, as well as the following custom functions that encode PIO "
"instructions and direct the assembler.  See sec 3.4 of the RP2040 datasheet "
"for further details."
msgstr ""
"State machine PIO diprogram dalam bahasa rakitan khusus dengan sembilan "
"instruksi mesin PIO inti. Dalam MicroPython, rutin rakitan PIO ditulis "
"sebagai fungsi Python dengan dekorator ``@rp2.asm_pio()``\\ , dan "
"menggunakan sintaks Python. Rutin tersebut mendukung variabel dan aritmatika"
" Python standar, serta fungsi khusus berikut yang mengenkode instruksi PIO "
"dan mengarahkan assembler. Lihat bagian 3.4 dari datasheet RP2040 untuk "
"detail lebih lanjut."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:98
msgid "wrap_target()"
msgstr "wrap_target()"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:99
msgid ""
"Specify the location where execution continues after program wrapping. By "
"default this is the start of the PIO routine."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan lokasi di mana eksekusi dilanjutkan setelah program wrapping. "
"Secara default ini adalah awal dari rutin PIO."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:102
msgid "wrap()"
msgstr "wrap()"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:103
msgid ""
"Specify the location where the program finishes and wraps around. If this "
"directive is not used then it is added automatically at the end of the PIO "
"routine.  Wrapping does not cost any execution cycles."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan lokasi di mana program selesai dan melingkari kembali. Jika "
"direktif ini tidak digunakan maka akan ditambahkan secara otomatis di akhir "
"rutin PIO. Wrapping tidak memerlukan siklus eksekusi apa pun."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:107
msgid "label(label)"
msgstr "label(label)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:108
msgid ""
"Define a label called *label* at the current location.  *label* can be a "
"string or integer."
msgstr ""
"Definisikan label bernama *label* di lokasi saat ini. *label* dapat berupa "
"string atau integer."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:111
msgid "word(instr, label=None)"
msgstr "word(instr, label=None)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:112
msgid "Insert an arbitrary 16-bit word in the assembled output."
msgstr "Sisipkan word 16-bit sembarang dalam output yang dirakit."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:114
msgid "*instr*: the 16-bit value"
msgstr "*instr*\\ : nilai 16-bit"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:115
msgid ""
"*label*: if given, look up the label and logical-or the label's value with "
"*instr*"
msgstr ""
"*label*\\ : jika diberikan, cari label dan lakukan logical-or nilai label "
"dengan *instr*"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:118
msgid "jmp(...)"
msgstr "jmp(...)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:119
msgid "This instruction takes two forms:"
msgstr "Instruksi ini mengambil dua bentuk:"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:121
msgid "jmp(label)"
msgstr "jmp(label)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:122
msgid "*label*: label to jump to unconditionally"
msgstr "*label*\\ : label untuk melompat tanpa syarat"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:124
msgid "jmp(cond, label)"
msgstr "jmp(cond, label)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:125
msgid "*cond*: the condition to check, one of:"
msgstr "*cond*\\ : kondisi yang akan diperiksa, salah satu dari:"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:127
msgid "``not_x``, ``not_y``: true if register is zero"
msgstr "``not_x``\\ , ``not_y``\\ : benar jika register bernilai nol"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:128
msgid ""
"``x_dec``, ``y_dec``: true if register is non-zero, and do post decrement"
msgstr ""
"``x_dec``\\ , ``y_dec``\\ : benar jika register bukan nol, dan lakukan post "
"decrement"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:130
msgid "``x_not_y``: true if X is not equal to Y"
msgstr "``x_not_y``\\ : benar jika X tidak sama dengan Y"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:131
msgid "``pin``: true if the input pin is set"
msgstr "``pin``\\ : benar jika pin input diset"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:132
msgid "``not_osre``: true if OSR is not empty (hasn't reached its threshold)"
msgstr ""
"``not_osre``\\ : benar jika OSR tidak kosong (belum mencapai ambang "
"batasnya)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:135
msgid "*label*: label to jump to if condition is true"
msgstr "*label*\\ : label untuk melompat jika kondisi benar"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:137
msgid "wait(polarity, src, index)"
msgstr "wait(polarity, src, index)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:138
msgid "Block, waiting for high/low on a pin or IRQ line."
msgstr "Blokir, menunggu tinggi/rendah pada pin atau jalur IRQ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:140
msgid "*polarity*: 0 or 1, whether to wait for a low or high value"
msgstr "*polarity*\\ : 0 atau 1, apakah menunggu nilai rendah atau tinggi"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:141
msgid ""
"*src*: one of: ``gpio`` (absolute pin), ``pin`` (pin relative to "
"StateMachine's ``in_base`` argument), ``irq``"
msgstr ""
"*src*\\ : salah satu dari: ``gpio`` (pin absolut), ``pin`` (pin relatif "
"terhadap argumen ``in_base`` StateMachine), ``irq``"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:143
msgid "*index*: 0-31, the index for *src*"
msgstr "*index*\\ : 0-31, indeks untuk *src*"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:145
msgid "in_(src, bit_count)"
msgstr "in_(src, bit_count)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:146
msgid "Shift data in from *src* to ISR."
msgstr "Geser data masuk dari *src* ke ISR."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:148
msgid "*src*: one of: ``pins``, ``x``, ``y``, ``null``, ``isr``, ``osr``"
msgstr ""
"*src*\\ : salah satu dari: ``pins``\\ , ``x``\\ , ``y``\\ , ``null``\\ , "
"``isr``\\ , ``osr``"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:149
msgid "*bit_count*: number of bits to shift in (1-32)"
msgstr "*bit_count*\\ : jumlah bit yang digeser masuk (1-32)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:151
msgid "out(dest, bit_count)"
msgstr "out(dest, bit_count)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:152
msgid "Shift data out from OSR to *dest*."
msgstr "Geser data keluar dari OSR ke *dest*\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:154
msgid ""
"*dest*: one of: ``pins``, ``x``, ``y``, ``pindirs``, ``pc``, ``isr``, "
"``exec``"
msgstr ""
"*dest*\\ : salah satu dari: ``pins``\\ , ``x``\\ , ``y``\\ , ``pindirs``\\ ,"
" ``pc``\\ , ``isr``\\ , ``exec``"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:156
msgid "*bit_count*: number of bits to shift out (1-32)"
msgstr "*bit_count*\\ : jumlah bit yang digeser keluar (1-32)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:158
msgid "push(...)"
msgstr "push(...)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:159
msgid ""
"Push ISR to the RX FIFO, then clear ISR to zero. This instruction takes the "
"following forms:"
msgstr ""
"Push ISR ke RX FIFO, lalu bersihkan ISR ke nol. Instruksi ini mengambil "
"bentuk-bentuk berikut:"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:162
msgid "push()"
msgstr "push()"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:163
msgid "push(block)"
msgstr "push(block)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:164
msgid "push(noblock)"
msgstr "push(noblock)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:165
msgid "push(iffull)"
msgstr "push(iffull)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:166
msgid "push(iffull, block)"
msgstr "push(iffull, block)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:167
msgid "push(iffull, noblock)"
msgstr "push(iffull, noblock)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:169
msgid ""
"If ``block`` is used then the instruction stalls if the RX FIFO is full. The"
" default is to block.  If ``iffull`` is used then it only pushes if the "
"input shift count has reached its threshold."
msgstr ""
"Jika ``block`` digunakan maka instruksi berhenti jika RX FIFO penuh. "
"Defaultnya adalah memblokir. Jika ``iffull`` digunakan maka instruksi hanya "
"push jika jumlah input shift telah mencapai ambang batasnya."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:173
msgid "pull(...)"
msgstr "pull(...)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:174
msgid ""
"Pull from the TX FIFO into OSR. This instruction takes the following forms:"
msgstr ""
"Pull dari TX FIFO ke OSR. Instruksi ini mengambil bentuk-bentuk berikut:"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:177
msgid "pull()"
msgstr "pull()"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:178
msgid "pull(block)"
msgstr "pull(block)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:179
msgid "pull(noblock)"
msgstr "pull(noblock)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:180
msgid "pull(ifempty)"
msgstr "pull(ifempty)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:181
msgid "pull(ifempty, block)"
msgstr "pull(ifempty, block)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:182
msgid "pull(ifempty, noblock)"
msgstr "pull(ifempty, noblock)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:184
msgid ""
"If ``block`` is used then the instruction stalls if the TX FIFO is empty. "
"The default is to block.  If ``ifempty`` is used then it only pulls if the "
"output shift count has reached its threshold."
msgstr ""
"Jika ``block`` digunakan maka instruksi berhenti jika TX FIFO kosong. "
"Defaultnya adalah memblokir. Jika ``ifempty`` digunakan maka instruksi hanya"
" pull jika jumlah output shift telah mencapai ambang batasnya."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:188
msgid "mov(dest, src)"
msgstr "mov(dest, src)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:189
msgid "Move into *dest* the value from *src*."
msgstr "Pindahkan nilai dari *src* ke *dest*\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:191
msgid ""
"*dest*: one of: ``pins``, ``x``, ``y``, ``exec``, ``pc``, ``isr``, ``osr``"
msgstr ""
"*dest*\\ : salah satu dari: ``pins``\\ , ``x``\\ , ``y``\\ , ``exec``\\ , "
"``pc``\\ , ``isr``\\ , ``osr``"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:192
msgid ""
"*src*: one of: ``pins``, ``x``, ``y``, ``null``, ``status``, ``isr``, "
"``osr``; this argument can be optionally modified by wrapping it in "
"``invert()`` or ``reverse()`` (but not both together)"
msgstr ""
"*src*\\ : salah satu dari: ``pins``\\ , ``x``\\ , ``y``\\ , ``null``\\ , "
"``status``\\ , ``isr``\\ , ``osr``\\ ; argumen ini dapat dimodifikasi secara"
" opsional dengan membungkusnya dalam ``invert()`` atau ``reverse()`` (tetapi"
" tidak keduanya sekaligus)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:196
msgid "irq(...)"
msgstr "irq(...)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:197
msgid "Set or clear an IRQ flag. This instruction takes two forms:"
msgstr "Set atau bersihkan flag IRQ. Instruksi ini mengambil dua bentuk:"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:200
msgid "irq(index)"
msgstr "irq(index)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:201 ../../library/rp2.rst:205
msgid "*index*: 0-7, or ``rel(0)`` to ``rel(7)``"
msgstr "*index*\\ : 0-7, atau ``rel(0)`` hingga ``rel(7)``"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:203
msgid "irq(mode, index)"
msgstr "irq(mode, index)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:204
msgid "*mode*: one of: ``block``, ``clear``"
msgstr "*mode*\\ : salah satu dari: ``block``\\ , ``clear``"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:207
msgid ""
"If ``block`` is used then the instruction stalls until the flag is cleared "
"by another entity.  If ``clear`` is used then the flag is cleared instead of"
" being set.  Relative IRQ indices add the state machine ID to the IRQ index "
"with modulo-4 addition.  IRQs 0-3 are visible from to the processor, 4-7 are"
" internal to the state machines."
msgstr ""
"Jika ``block`` digunakan maka instruksi berhenti sampai flag dibersihkan "
"oleh entitas lain. Jika ``clear`` digunakan maka flag dibersihkan alih-alih "
"diset. Indeks IRQ relatif menambahkan ID state machine ke indeks IRQ dengan "
"penambahan modulo-4. IRQ 0-3 terlihat dari prosesor, 4-7 bersifat internal "
"untuk state machine."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:213
msgid "set(dest, data)"
msgstr "set(dest, data)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:214
msgid "Set *dest* with the value *data*."
msgstr "Set *dest* dengan nilai *data*\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:216
msgid "*dest*: ``pins``, ``x``, ``y``, ``pindirs``"
msgstr "*dest*\\ : ``pins``\\ , ``x``\\ , ``y``\\ , ``pindirs``"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:217
msgid "*data*: value (0-31)"
msgstr "*data*\\ : nilai (0-31)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:219
msgid "nop()"
msgstr "nop()"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:220
msgid ""
"This is a pseudoinstruction that assembles to ``mov(y, y)`` and has no side "
"effect."
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah pseudoinstruksi yang dirakit menjadi ``mov(y, y)`` dan tidak "
"memiliki efek samping."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:223
msgid ".side(value)"
msgstr ".side(value)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:224
msgid ""
"This is a modifier which can be applied to any instruction, and is used to "
"control side-set pin values."
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah modifier yang dapat diterapkan pada instruksi apa pun, dan "
"digunakan untuk mengontrol nilai pin side-set."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:227
msgid "*value*: the value (bits) to output on the side-set pins"
msgstr "*value*\\ : nilai (bit) yang akan dikeluarkan pada pin side-set"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:229
msgid ".delay(value)"
msgstr ".delay(value)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:230
msgid ""
"This is a modifier which can be applied to any instruction, and specifies "
"how many cycles to delay for after the instruction executes."
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah modifier yang dapat diterapkan pada instruksi apa pun, dan "
"menentukan berapa banyak siklus yang harus ditunda setelah instruksi "
"dieksekusi."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:233
msgid ""
"*value*: cycles to delay, 0-31 (maximum value reduced if side-set pins are "
"used)"
msgstr ""
"*value*\\ : siklus untuk ditunda, 0-31 (nilai maksimum berkurang jika pin "
"side-set digunakan)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:236
msgid "[value]"
msgstr "[value]"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:237
msgid "This is a modifier and is equivalent to ``.delay(value)``."
msgstr "Ini adalah modifier dan setara dengan ``.delay(value)``\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:241
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Kelas"
